# IBM AML dataset (large, regenerable via a prepare_mulegraph.py-style
# conversion of a Kaggle download -- see data/aml/README.md, kept tracked).
# Same treatment as ml/data/raw/: the bulk data itself is not source-controlled.
# (A directory-level ignore can't be selectively un-ignored, hence per-extension/subdir rules.)
data/aml/*.csv
data/aml/*.json
data/aml/*.txt
data/aml/legacy/
ml/data/aml/

# Raw copy of the externally-prepared dataset package, kept locally only
# for inspection during integration -- unused by any code path (the actual
# runtime/training data lives in data/aml/ and ml/data/aml/splits/ above).
ml/mulegraph-aml/

